Rate-change cutoff	Whether old-rate dispatch requests already approved but not dispatched are cancelled, and the exact effective timestamp and exception authority.
Rates	Tax, freight, destination, quantity and validity components; whether approval limits vary by rate deviation.
Balance confirmation	Quarter schedule, send date, standard response due date, block date and exceptions for disputed balances.
Commission	Whether commission calculation and settlement reconciliation belong in this product and the exact UltraTech rules.
Notifications	Final channels, recipient hierarchy, escalation cadence, quiet hours and WhatsApp/push requirements.
Scale	Expected number of clients, users, monthly POs and dispatch requests, ledger rows, payments and documents.
